    "content": {
      "rendered": "<div id=\"fh-jobpost\">\n<div style=\"background:#E4F3EA;border-left:5px solid #1E8E4E;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 22px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#123D28;\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Qualys Internship 2027 is open in Pune for the Intern, Engineering role (Req R0005182), aimed at BE/BTech students in CS, IT or a related branch who graduate in 2027. Apply by 27 Nov 2026 on the official Qualys Workday portal; the stipend and duration are not disclosed.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background:#0F3D2A;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;padding:13px 18px;\">Qualys Internship 2027 &mdash; job details at a glance</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Company</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Qualys</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Role</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Intern, Engineering</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Requisition ID</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">R0005182</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Location</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Pune, Maharashtra (work mode not stated)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Eligibility</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">BE/BTech CS, IT or related &ndash; 2027 batch (currently pursuing)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Experience</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Students / freshers</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Stipend</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Official: Not disclosed | Reported: about &#8377;41,000/month (Myinternships, one Qualys Pune intern listing)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Duration</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Not stated</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Posted on</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">24 Nov 2026</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Apply by</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">27 Nov 2026 (night, IST)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_90 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-light-blue ez-toc-container-direction\">\n<div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\"><p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Job Summary</p>\n</div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/qualys-internship-2027/#Qualys_Internship_2027_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\" >Qualys Internship 2027 &ndash; full job details</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/qualys-internship-2027/#What_you_will_do_in_the_Qualys_Internship_2027_role\" >What you will do in the Qualys Internship 2027 role</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/qualys-internship-2027/#Qualys_Internship_2027_eligibility\" >Qualys Internship 2027 eligibility</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/qualys-internship-2027/#Qualys_Internship_2027_selection_process\" >Qualys Internship 2027 selection process</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/qualys-internship-2027/#Documents_required\" >Documents required</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/qualys-internship-2027/#Preparation_tips_for_the_Qualys_Internship_2027\" >Preparation tips for the Qualys Internship 2027</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/qualys-internship-2027/#How_to_apply_for_Qualys_Internship_2027\" >How to apply for Qualys Internship 2027</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/qualys-internship-2027/#About_Qualys\" >About Qualys</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/qualys-internship-2027/#Frequently_asked_questions\" >Frequently asked questions</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Qualys_Internship_2027_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\"></span>Qualys Internship 2027 &ndash; full job details<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Qualys Internship 2027 gives engineering students a seat on the team that builds the Qualys cloud security platform in Pune. The listing, titled Intern, Engineering, went live on 24 November 2026, and the Workday portal is set to stop taking applications after 27 November, so the window is only a few days long.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Each intern is paired with a mentor and owns one project from start to finish. The posting also mentions a possible full-time offer at the end, though it does not promise one. Qualys has not published the stipend, internship length, start month or work mode, and we have not filled those gaps with guesses.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#FDEBEA;border-left:5px solid #C8372B;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#5B1A14;\"><strong>2027 batch only:</strong> the requisition asks for students currently pursuing BE/BTech who graduate in 2027. Candidates who passed out in 2025 or 2026 do not match this opening.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFF6E3;border-left:5px solid #E1A006;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A3706;\"><strong>Short window, missing details:</strong> the portal is scheduled to close after 27 Nov 2026. Stipend, duration and joining date are not stated, so ask the recruiter for them in writing if you are shortlisted.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"What_you_will_do_in_the_Qualys_Internship_2027_role\"></span>What you will do in the Qualys Internship 2027 role<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Take a mentored project through design, coding and testing</li>\n<li>Add and refine features on the Qualys cloud-based security platform</li>\n<li>Write tidy code backed by unit and integration tests</li>\n<li>Record your work in documentation and share learnings with the team</li>\n<li>Try out AI and machine learning ideas for the product and for the way the team builds it</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Qualys_Internship_2027_eligibility\"></span>Qualys Internship 2027 eligibility<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The Qualys Internship 2027 requisition lists these requirements, summarised in our own words:</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Pursuing BE/BTech in Computer Science, IT or a related branch, passing out in 2027</li>\n<li>A solid grip on data structures, algorithms and object-oriented programming</li>\n<li>Coding ability in Java, Python, C++ or a comparable language</li>\n<li>Strong problem solving and the habit of asking good questions</li>\n<li>Basic AI/ML awareness: ML fundamentals, LLMs, or something you built with AI tools or APIs</li>\n<li>Clear communication and real eagerness to learn</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Good to have: SQL or NoSQL basics, REST APIs, Spring Boot, Docker, Kubernetes or any public cloud, plus personal, hackathon, open-source or coursework projects, ideally with an AI angle. <strong>Not stated:</strong> CGPA cut-off, backlog rule, duration and joining date. Treat any figure you see elsewhere for these as unconfirmed.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\"><strong>Expected stipend:</strong> the Qualys Internship 2027 stipend has not been disclosed. A Qualys Pune intern listing on Myinternships (GRC and Compliance intern, 4 months, hybrid) shows about &#8377;41,000 per month. That is a single data point for a different team, and AmbitionBox and Glassdoor carry no reliable Qualys intern stipend data, so use it as a rough indication and check your offer letter.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Qualys_Internship_2027_selection_process\"></span>Qualys Internship 2027 selection process<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Qualys has not published the selection rounds for the Qualys Internship 2027. Based on how product companies usually hire engineering interns, plan for these steps:</p>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Resume shortlisting against the job description</li>\n<li>Online coding test on DSA and core computer science</li>\n<li>One or two technical interviews on DSA, OOP, your projects and basic AI/ML</li>\n<li>HR or manager discussion on stipend, start date and availability</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">These are typical rounds for a Qualys Internship 2027 applicant, not confirmed ones. Watch your email and the Workday candidate inbox for the real schedule.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Documents_required\"></span>Documents required<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>An updated one-page resume (build one with our <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/resume-builder/\">Resume Builder</a>)</li>\n<li>College ID or bonafide certificate showing the 2027 batch</li>\n<li>Semester mark sheets so far</li>\n<li>Links to GitHub, project demos or hackathon certificates</li>\n<li>A government photo ID</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Preparation_tips_for_the_Qualys_Internship_2027\"></span>Preparation tips for the Qualys Internship 2027<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Revise arrays, strings, hashing, trees, graphs and dynamic programming, and write clean, tested solutions</li>\n<li>Explain OOP ideas such as inheritance, polymorphism and interfaces with code in your main language</li>\n<li>Prepare one AI project story: the problem, the model or API you used and what you would improve</li>\n<li>Read the basics of cloud security, such as vulnerability scanning and asset inventory, since that is the product area</li>\n<li>Practise a 60-second intro with our <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/self-introduction-for-interview/\">self-introduction guide</a> and try the free <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/tools/\">career tools</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"How_to_apply_for_Qualys_Internship_2027\"></span>How to apply for Qualys Internship 2027<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Open the official <a href=\"https://qualys.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/Careers/job/Pune/Intern--Engineering_R0005182-1\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Qualys Intern, Engineering listing (R0005182)</a></li>\n<li>Click Apply and sign in or create a Workday account</li>\n<li>Upload your resume and enter 2027 as your graduation year</li>\n<li>Answer the screening questions and submit before 27 Nov 2026 night (IST)</li>\n<li>Save the confirmation email and track your status in the Workday candidate home</li>\n</ol>\n<div style=\"background:#F3F6F4;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#43514A;\"><strong>Related:</strong> the Qualys Internship 2027 is limited to the 2027 batch. Already graduated? See the <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/qualys-off-campus-drive-2027/\">Qualys Off Campus Drive 2027</a> for the Software Engineer role in Pune, and browse more <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/companies-hiring-freshers/\">companies hiring freshers</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"About_Qualys\"></span>About Qualys<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Qualys is a cloud security and compliance company founded in 1999 and headquartered in Foster City, California. Its cloud platform covers vulnerability management, asset inventory, policy compliance and web application security for enterprises around the world, and the company runs a large engineering centre in Pune. Official site: <a href=\"https://www.qualys.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">qualys.com</a>.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Frequently_asked_questions\"></span>Frequently asked questions<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">What is the stipend for the Qualys Internship 2027?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Qualys has not disclosed it. One Qualys Pune intern listing on Myinternships shows about &#8377;41,000 per month, but it is for a different team, so treat it only as a rough reported figure.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Who is eligible for the Qualys Internship 2027?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Students currently pursuing BE/BTech in Computer Science, IT or a related branch who will graduate in 2027. 2025 and 2026 graduates do not match this listing.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Do I need AI/ML knowledge for this internship?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Basic AI/ML understanding is a listed requirement: ML fundamentals, LLMs, or a project built with AI tools or APIs. Deep expertise is not asked for.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Where is the Qualys Intern, Engineering role located?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">The listing is for Pune, Maharashtra. Whether it is on-site or hybrid is not stated.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">How do I apply for the Qualys Internship 2027?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Apply on the official Qualys Workday page for requisition R0005182 before 27 Nov 2026 night (IST), using the link in the How to apply section above.</p>\n</details>\n<p><a id=\"fh-apply-src\" href=\"https://qualys.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/Careers/job/Pune/Intern--Engineering_R0005182-1\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" hidden target=\"_blank\">Apply on official portal</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Intern, Engineering\",\"description\":\"Qualys is hiring an Intern, Engineering in Pune. 2027-batch BE/BTech students in Computer Science, IT or related branches work on a mentored project on the Qualys cloud security platform: design, coding, unit and integration tests, documentation and AI/ML exploration. Skills: data structures, algorithms, OOP, Java, Python or C++, problem solving, basic AI/ML. Stipend and duration not disclosed.\",\"identifier\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Qualys\",\"value\":\"R0005182\"},\"datePosted\":\"2026-11-24\",\"validThrough\":\"2026-11-27T23:59:59+05:30\",\"employmentType\":[\"INTERN\",\"FULL_TIME\"],\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Qualys\",\"sameAs\":\"https://www.qualys.com\"},\"jobLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Pune\",\"addressRegion\":\"Maharashtra\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}},\"educationRequirements\":\"Pursuing BE/BTech in Computer Science, IT or a related field, graduating in 2027\",\"experienceRequirements\":\"No prior experience required (students)\",\"directApply\":false,\"url\":\"https://qualys.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/Careers/job/Pune/Intern--Engineering_R0005182-1\"}</script><br />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"NewsArticle\",\"headline\":\"Qualys Internship 2027: Intern, Engineering (2027 Batch) in Pune\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-25T10:16:00+05:30\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-25T10:16:00+05:30\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Freshershunt\",\"url\":\"https://freshershunt.in/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Freshershunt\",\"url\":\"https://freshershunt.in/\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://freshershunt.in/qualys-internship-2027/\"}</script><br />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the stipend for the Qualys Internship 2027?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Qualys has not disclosed it. One Qualys Pune intern listing on Myinternships shows about &#8377;41,000 per month, but it is for a different team, so treat it only as a rough reported figure.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is eligible for the Qualys Internship 2027?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Students currently pursuing BE/BTech in Computer Science, IT or a related branch who will graduate in 2027. 2025 and 2026 graduates do not match this listing.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need AI/ML knowledge for this internship?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Basic AI/ML understanding is a listed requirement: ML fundamentals, LLMs, or a project built with AI tools or APIs. Deep expertise is not asked for.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is the Qualys Intern, Engineering role located?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The listing is for Pune, Maharashtra. Whether it is on-site or hybrid is not stated.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I apply for the Qualys Internship 2027?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Apply on the official Qualys Workday page for requisition R0005182 before 27 Nov 2026 night (IST), using the link in the How to apply section above.\"}}]}</script></p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" class=\"sharethis-inline-share-buttons\" ></div>",
